WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.754
You send one drawing and spec.

00:02.883 --> 00:07.791
Sourza's AI will read the drawing and flag anything missing.

00:07.917 --> 00:11.409
You confirm material, quantity and finish.

00:11.517 --> 00:16.425
It will match plants in India that can make your part,
and invite them to quote.

00:16.550 --> 00:18.890
You compare the quotes side by side.

00:19.017 --> 00:22.029
You speak to the plant's engineer before you order.

00:22.150 --> 00:25.474
You confirm the order and pay the plant directly.

00:25.583 --> 00:32.987
The plant will share production updates and its inspection report
before dispatch, and it ships on the terms you agreed.

00:33.117 --> 00:37.257
Your parts arrive, and the job stays on file for your next order.

00:37.383 --> 00:41.211
How Sourza works.
Register on Sourza today.
